<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN SHARES LOSE 2.5 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN SHARES LOSE 2.5 PERCENT.</headline>
<text>
<p>1203 GMT - Bel-20 index  .BFX slides 2.5 percent to well below 2,400-point support level, hit by Wall Street  .DJI losses, weak dollar DEM= and losses on neighbouring markets amid worries U.S. retail sales and PPI data  US-ECI due at 1230 GMT will come in strong, stoking U.S. inflation and rate rise worries.</p>
<p>* Bel-20 index  .BFX down 2.52 percent at 2,390.20 points.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
